thumb_up.jpg: a thumb up, for the gestures' tests and screenshots (lot
4). Cropped to 16:9 and scaled to 1280 × 720 from "Koichi Wakata thumbs
up.jpg", a photograph by NASA (KSC-00PP-1463), in the public domain:

    https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Koichi_Wakata_thumbs_up.jpg

raised_hand.jpg: a hand raised, open, for the gestures' tests and
screenshots (lot 4). Cropped to 16:9 and scaled to 1280 × 720 from
"ISS-36 Cassidy waves to support personnel.jpg", a photograph by NASA
(201309110036hq), in the public domain:

    https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:ISS-36_Cassidy_waves_to_support_personnel.jpg

far.jpg: a person further from the camera, off the middle, for Cadrage's
test and screenshots (lot 4). Cropped to 16:9 and scaled to 1280 × 720
from "NASA astronaut Jonny Kim waves for a portrait while removing
research hardware (iss073e0222463).jpg", a photograph by NASA, in the
public domain:

    https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:NASA_astronaut_Jonny_Kim_waves_for_a_portrait_while_removing_research_hardware_(iss073e0222463).jpg

As person.jpg, these are works of the United States government; their use
must not suggest that NASA endorses anything.
